    "updated_at": "2022-04-05T14:07:36Z",
    "body": "So if you look at the discussion at [OpenUI](https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/322) about this, the biggest holdup was the lack of symmetry. I definitely agree. Dialog’s `show`/`close` pair isn’t symmetric. Folks were fairly happy with either `show`/`hide` or `open`/`close`. Since it sounds like there’s pushback on changing `close`, perhaps I could propose we change to `open` (and `openModal`)?",
